{"chunk_id": "e0b51097c36a", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "产业概述", "date_hint": "", "text": "1.1 行业属性工业母机属于高端装备制造业，是制造机器的机器，是国家制造强国战略的核心支撑产业。行业涵盖金属切削机床、金属成形机床、数控系统及核心功能部件等领域，其技术水平直接决定了汽车、航空航天、新能源等高端制造领域的发展高度。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "e0b51097c36a", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
