{"chunk_id": "10f3e0f106fa", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "产业概述", "date_hint": "", "text": "\"工业母机是制造强国的核心支撑，是产业链供应链安全的关键保障。\"——来源：工信部《高端数控机床与基础制造装备创新发展三年行动计划(2026-2028年)》产业规模：", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "10f3e0f106fa", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "647917899f90", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "产业概述", "date_hint": "", "text": "2023年中国工业母机市场规模达到2320亿元\n2024年市场规模增长至2850亿元，同比增长8.6%\n2025年市场规模达到3200亿元，同比增长12.3%\n预计2026年市场规模将突破3500亿元，2029年将超过8000亿元\n政策支持：国家先后出台《制造业重点产业链高质量发展行动计划(2023—2025年)》《工业母机高质量发展行动计划(2025—2030年)》《高端数控机床与基础制造装备创新发展三年行动计划(2026-2028年)》等政策，明确将高档数控机床列为十大重点产业链之一，2024年国家制造业转型升级基金对工业母机领域投资规模达127亿元，同比增长35%。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "647917899f90", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
